          "dataType": "value",
          "angle": 180
        }
      ],
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "node-composition-consumption-smoke"
        },
        "markdown": "## Pass procedure\n\n1. Confirm **Composition Smoke Node** is available from the Bridge.\n2. Create another instance from Elements or the Bridge create handle.\n3. Confirm the widget has **Root** and **Action** handles only.\n4. Root Detail renders **Root / Shared Detail**.\n5. Root Summary renders **Shared Summary**.\n6. Action Detail renders **Action Detail**.\n7. Action Summary renders **Action Summary**.\n8. Both interfaces use the shared Icon and Hub glyph.\n9. Entering through Root focuses the default-view target.\n\n**Pass:** the newly created instance matches the authored specimen already placed here."
      }
    }
